    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>12级 杂兵 游击</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>中型 自然界 野兽（蜘蛛）</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 1；失手攻击无法伤害杂兵</span><span>''先攻'' +15</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 26，''强韧'' 24，''反射'' 25，''意志'' 22</span><span>''侦查'' +11</span></div>\n<div><span>''抗力'' 10 毒素</span><span>''感官'' 黑暗视觉，震动感知 5</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 6，攀爬 6（蛛行）</span><span></span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">特性</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">网行</div>\n<div class=description>该蜘蛛无视由网构成的困难地形。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}啮咬（毒素）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：近战 1（一个生物）+17vs.AC<br>命中：10 点伤害，如果目标定身、受缚、震慑或昏迷则再追加 5 点毒素伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">次要动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/range}}捆网✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：射程 10（一个生物）+15vs.反射<br>命中：目标定身直到其下回合结束。</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''技能'' 运动+17，隐秘+18</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 22（+12）</span><span>''敏捷'' 24（+13）</span><span>''感知'' 20（+11）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 19（+10）</span><span>''智力'' 1（+1）</span><span>''魅力'' 8（+5）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 无</span></div></div>\n</div>",
